        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, `vim.g.minixxx_disable` disables globally and buffer-local variables won't have effect. Here is [one solution](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/78a4d457718060fe80480c72a7d64f6b23472d63/doc/mini.txt#L325-L326) of how to enable only in certain filetypes.\r\n\r\nAnother one would be to set `vim.b.minixxx_disable = true` for every buffer in `BufNew` and `VimEnter`, while setting it to `false` later when user needs it.",
